  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>X</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8746;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8746;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>[Using distributive law]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>]</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Again, consider <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>X</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8746;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8746;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>]</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Thus from Eq. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p>",
